        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omukama Asa Naasingura Abanyesopiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Abiya akagwijagira, yatabaazibwa hamu na baisenkuru omu rubuga rwa Daudi, omutabani Asa, yajuumura engoma. Omu businge bwe, ensi ekagwagwana okumara emyaka ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa akakora ebirungi kandi ebihikire ebirukusiimwa MUKAMA Ruhanga we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaihaho amatambiro ag'abanyamahanga, n'ebiikaro ebi baaramizaamuga, yahenda enyomyo, yatematema ekisisani ky'Asera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaragira Yuda kukora MUKAMA Ruhanga owa baisenkurubo ebyagonza n'okukwata Ebiragiro n'Ebigambo bye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba akahwerekereza ebiikaro by'abakafiiri eby'okuramizaamu n'amatambiro ag'okucumiikiirraho obubbaani, yabimara omu mbuga za Yuda zoona, ha bulemi bwe obukama bukatunga obusinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akombeka embuga ezigumire omunsi ya Yuda, habwokuba ensi ekaba eteekaine. Omu myaka egi, busaho ayamurwanisize, habwokuba MUKAMA akamuha obusinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akagambira Yuda ati, “Twombeke embuga zinu, tuzizitiirre ebisiika, twitemu eminaara amalembo n'ebihongozo; ensi ekyali yaitu, habwokuba tukakora MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu ekyarukugonza, tukakora ekyarukugonza, na uwe nukwo kutuha obusinge ha mbaju zoona.” Nubwo bayombeka, baatunga obusinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Asa akaba aina ihe eryarugire omu Baayuda, ery'abantu obusiiriira busatu, abaajwaraga engabu entoito, bakwasire n'amacumu, kandi abaarugire omu Baabenyamiini, obusiiriira bubiri, n'obukumi munaana, abaarwanisaaga engabu n'obuta; abo boona bakaba bali basaija b'amaani, kandi manzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zeera Omunyesopiya, akabaseesira azinisize ihe ery'abantu akakaikuru kamu, n'ebigaali ebikumi bisatu, baahikira kimu Maleesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa yagenda kumurumba, boombi baasimba enkarra bakwatangane omu kihanga ekya Zefasa, haihi na Maleesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa yaterra MUKAMA Ruhanga we omuranga naagamba ati, “Ai MUKAMA, busaho n'omu, okwihaho iwe wenka, niiwe osobora kurwanirra ataina busobozi, kurwanisa ow'obusobozi. Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, otukonyere, habwokuba tukwesiga, kandi abantu abaingi abarukwingana hanu, twizire kubarwanisa omu ibara lyawe. Ai MUKAMA, niwe Ruhanga waitu, otaikiriza omuntu n'omu kukusingura.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA nukwo yasingwiire Abanyesopiya ati, Asa na Yuda nibarora, Abanyesopiya bairuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa n'abantu aba akaba ainabo, baabairukya baabahikya Geera, Abanyesopiya baafa, okuhika boona obu baahweriireho kimu; habwokuba bakasasangurwa MUKAMA n'ihe rye. Abantu ba Yuda banyaga ebintu bingi muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baateera embuga zoona ezikaba ziherraine Geera, habwokuba abantu ab'omu mbuga ezi, MUKAMA akaba abatiinisize. Baanyaga embuga ezi zoona, habwokuba zikaba zirumu eminyago nyingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi baaseesira ensiisira z'abahuma abamu, banyaga entaama n'engamiya ebitabarwa. Hanyuma nubwo baagarukire Yerusaalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
